{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Spamton — the salesman who predicts the future\n\nAntagonist of Ch.2, secret boss as Spamton NEO. Former partner and now rival of Tenna.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Predicts the Weird Route**\n'Freedom in exchange for crying in a broken home' — and Tenna's death.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Strange Someone**\nAwakened alongside Jevil through the Shadow Crystal.","x":390,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nKnows about the Shadow Mantle via the manhole that connects both rooms.","x":-130,"y":398,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Dark Crystal**\nOne of its Holders; theme of freedom.","x":-650,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_ch5","type":"text","text":"**Pink inherits his strings (Ch.5)**\nThe Shadow Crystal boss of Ch.5 manifests the same green strings that bound Spamton.","x":-900,"y":300,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_addison","type":"text","text":"**The White Addison**\nAn unsuccessful spam salesman; dreamed of being a 'big shot'.","x":900,"y":-700,"width":290,"height":165,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_call","type":"text","text":"**The mysterious call**\nSomeone unidentified helps him succeed — then abandons him right before signing with Tenna.","x":900,"y":-350,"width":290,"height":165,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_friendcat","type":"text","text":"**Connection with FRIEND**\nHis glasses share colors with FRIEND; he equips items with anti-cat defense to protect himself from it.","x":900,"y":650,"width":290,"height":165,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_thornring.png","x":-129,"y":-938,"width":256,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_oldposter.jpg","x":775,"y":-108,"width":260,"height":139},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/tenna_introduction.webp","x":-129,"y":758,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s_addison-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_adison.png","x":1237,"y":-914,"width":143,"height":190},{"id":"s_call-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_telephone.gif","x":1280,"y":-467,"width":107,"height":190},{"id":"s_garbage-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_z_room.webp","x":1295,"y":7,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s_friendcat-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":1229,"y":851,"width":205,"height":190},{"id":"s_garbage","type":"text","text":"**'Just garbage noise'**\nThe sound echo of his fall is associated with the same type of static linked to Gaster.","x":890,"y":160,"width":290,"height":165,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shadow_Crystal_item.webp","x":-880,"y":-360,"width":62,"height":80},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton.gif","x":-79,"y":-260,"width":169,"height":190},{"id":"s_eram","type":"text","text":"**ERAM (Shadow Mantle Holder)**\nSame musical motif (BIG SHOT/BURNING EYES); both candidates for 'Strange Someone'.","x":-1236,"y":300,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_qanda","type":"text","text":"**2022 Q&A (more answers)** Confirms that he stole Lancer's swatch \"Lucas\" and that he was friends with Jevil before \"tricking him\" — but says he doesn't know who the Knight is, contradicting his in-game dialogue.","x":-900,"y":-400,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_roomz","type":"text","text":"**Room Z, his former office?**\nA rank-Z room (the lowest) in the TV World of Ch.3, with a rotary phone identical to the one in his shop, hung up and disconnected — the same detail that Addisons and Tenna mention about his disappearance.","x":-1236,"y":1121,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_puppetcat","type":"text","text":"**The \"Puppet/Cat\" element**\nAccording to Spamton himself in the 2022 Q&A, there's a hidden damage type called this (Element 6) — several of his items (Dealmaker, FrayedBowtie, TrueTie) specifically reduce that damage.","x":-896,"y":1121,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s_puppetcat-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-896,"y":1350,"width":183,"height":170},{"id":"s_qanda-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_telephone.gif","x":-1250,"y":-620,"width":107,"height":190},{"id":"s_marioneta","type":"text","text":"**Why does he have a puppet shape instead of a normal Addison's?**\nSpamton implies that the Swatchlings threw him into the acid river of Queen's Mansion — the acid \"shrinks\", and Spamton NEO's strings are the same green. Not fully confirmed.","x":-620,"y":1350,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_marioneta-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_theory_acid_small.png","x":-620,"y":1610,"width":300,"height":169},{"id":"s_eram-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/shadow_mantle.gif","x":-1186,"y":130,"width":170,"height":170},{"id":"s_ch5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_swatch.png","x":-825,"y":473,"width":130,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_ch5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_addison","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_addison","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_call","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_call","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_garbage","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_garbage","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_friendcat","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_friendcat","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_ch5-img-e","fromNode":"s_ch5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_ch5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_addison-img-e","fromNode":"s_addison-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_addison","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_call-img-e","fromNode":"s_call-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_call","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_garbage-img-e","fromNode":"s_garbage-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_garbage","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s_friendcat-img-e","fromNode":"s_friendcat-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_friendcat","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_eram","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_eram","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_eram_img","fromNode":"s_eram-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_eram","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"e_qanda","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_qanda","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_roomz","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_roomz","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_puppetcat","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_puppetcat","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_puppetcat-img","fromNode":"s_puppetcat-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_puppetcat","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_qanda-img","fromNode":"s_qanda-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_qanda","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_marioneta","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_marioneta","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_marioneta-img","fromNode":"s_marioneta-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_marioneta","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_addison_marioneta","fromNode":"s_addison","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_marioneta","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_tenna_roomz","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_roomz","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_eram_crystal","fromNode":"s_eram","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_qanda_jevil","fromNode":"s_qanda","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_call_addison","fromNode":"s_call","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_addison","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_garbage_call","fromNode":"s_garbage","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_call","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_puppetcat_friendcat","fromNode":"s_puppetcat","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_friendcat","toSide":"right","color":"3"}]}